      ],
      "source": "https://www.southcarolinagenealogy.org/counties/anderson/towns/la-france"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Upstate places like La France often reflect the geography of the Revolutionary War and early Scots-Irish backcountry settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
